#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ezyflow_bridge.field_product_template__ezy_rotation_date_type
msgid ""
"The date the warehouse rotates this product's stock on: it captures that "
"date at reception and ships the oldest first. Empty: the receipt date, first"
" in first out. Only a product tracked by lots or by serial numbers can have "
"one. Odoo's own stock carries no such date; the warehouse keeps it."
msgstr ""

#. module: ezyflow_bridge
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ezyflow_bridge.field_product_product__ezy_shop_product_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ezyflow_bridge.field_product_template__ezy_shop_product_id
msgid ""
"The id this product has in the web shop. The connector uses it to find the "
"Odoo record before falling back to the internal reference. One shop per Odoo"
" product."
msgstr ""

#. module: ezyflow_bridge
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ezyflow_bridge.field_product_product__ezy_shop_variant_id
msgid ""
"The id this variant has in the web shop. The connector uses it to find the "
"Odoo record before falling back to the internal reference. One shop per Odoo"
" product."
msgstr ""

#. module: ezyflow_bridge
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ezyflow_bridge.field_product_product__ezy_sku_key
