"written by the connector when the order is created. A difference with the "
"order total is shown on the form; the order is never refused for it. A total"
" of zero reads as not set, so a fully discounted order never warns."
msgstr ""

#. module: ezyflow_bridge
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ezyflow_bridge.field_stock_picking__ezy_wms_state
msgid ""
